<view class="page-shell poster-page"><view class="title">把这一刻，留成一张卡</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="status">正在排版你的星座海报…</view><image wx:if="{{src}}" class="poster-image" src="{{src}}" mode="widthFix" bindtap="preview" show-menu-by-longpress /><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="status"><view>暂时没能生成海报</view><button wx:if="{{card}}" style="width:100%" class="ghost-button" bindtap="generate">重新生成</button></view><block wx:if="{{src}}"><button style="width:100%" class="primary-button" bindtap="preview">打开大图 · 长按保存或分享</button><button style="width:100%" class="ghost-button" open-type="share">同时分享这张卡的小程序</button><view class="note">海报是一张图片。发送小程序卡片后，朋友可以直接进入同一结果，也能体验自己的卡片。</view></block><canvas type="2d" id="posterCanvas" class="poster-canvas"></canvas></view>
